  "name": "ShapeCraft — free open-source direct-modeling CAD (alpha)",
  "summary": "Local-first solid modeler on Open CASCADE: sketch on any face, pull it into a solid, drag edges to round them; every step stays editable in History. Opens .shapr, STEP, Parasolid, IGES, STL, OBJ, 3MF and DXF/SVG sketches. Aimed at 3D-printing parts, enclosures and props. No account or telemetry; macOS, Windows, Linux (plus Android/iOS builds). Built-in tutorials in 11 languages.",
